  {
    "index": 3,
    "hash": "ljuOi7nkYzNV6NYOG6q77BR6t0c=",
    "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:29:40.042Z",
    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "The flag on Centric states the disqualifier in its own words: product IP is a channel-conflict risk. The tool field explains the scale of it \u2014 more than 200 of its own software products, plus Peppol \u2014 against verticals of public, retail, banking and industry, and a Dutch profile of insurance, public and retail.\n\nThe mechanism is straightforward and hard to work around. A partner that already sells its own product for a given process has a revenue line to protect, so placing a competing build in front of the same buyer costs it money. Channel conflict is not a matter of goodwill; with a portfolio that broad, the overlap with almost any candidate solution is close to certain.\n\nOwnership churn compounds it. The firm was acquired by the Imker Capital consortium in July 2024, the flag says strategy is unsettled and the current structure needs verifying, and revenue is recorded at 425 million with no currency stated. On top of that the row is a provisional v2 tail entry, mechanically rescored on size and slot occupancy, with an OSS-portfolio screen still outstanding \u2014 so the one well-evidenced thing about Centric is the conflict.\n\n---\n\n## Leads sharing this finding (1)\n\n**9 \u00b7 do not pitch**\n- Centric (NL)\n\nVerbatim research text this claim was extracted from:\n\n> \u26a0 M&A: acquired by Imker Capital consortium (Jul-2024). Ownership changed; strategy unsettled. \u00b7 DERIVED, NOT SCORED ON v3 \u2014 v2 row rescored mechanically (size + slot-occupancy only). Run the OSS-portfolio screen before acting. v2 verticals: Public, retail, banking, industry \u00b7 NL profile: insurance, public, retail \u00b7 rev 425000000 \u00b7 Ownership changed Jul-2024; verify current structure. Product IP is a channel-conflict risk.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-19T11:29:40.042149Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-19T11:29:40.042153Z"
    }
  },
